Type: Package
Package: downscaleMagpie
Title: Downscaling of MAgPIE Outputs to 0.5 Degree
Version: 0.1.0.9001
Date: 2026-10-16
Authors@R: c(
    person("Patrick", "von Jeetze", , "vjeetze@pik-potsdam.de", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-1197-4412")),
    person("Pascal", "Sauer", role = "aut")
  )
Description: Prepares the outputs of a MAgPIE run for the model-agnostic downscaling kernels of
    luscale and writes the gridded results: readers of the gdx, the configuration and the 0.5 degree
    files of the output folder, the MAgPIE-specific products (land with sub-types and transitions by
    stage, peatland, land conservation, age classes, cropland split, biodiversity intactness) and a
    writer of the output files.
